     "author": {
      "accountId": "6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2961919de700a07ec22a098da2a90a31?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMD-0.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2961919de700a07ec22a098da2a90a31?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMD-0.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2961919de700a07ec22a098da2a90a31?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMD-0.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/2961919de700a07ec22a098da2a90a31?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FMD-0.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Michael Durbin",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I suspect this is because the importer imports the container first, then the children.  Addition of children updates the modification date of parent resources.  A solution to this might be to rework the import code to do a first pass that creates placeholder nodes for everything that is to be imported and then work from leaf to root.  One should evaluate such a change in approach to see if it might also address the challenges associated with ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2459"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2459",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " and for performance implications.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "An approach that would involve less reworking would be simply to patch parents with the correct dates after all children are added when doing a lossless import. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
