  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When I export repo A and then import into a repo B (that is running in relaxed mode)  the fedora:lastModified  values of the root containers of do not match between A and B.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. In one shell run:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "java -Dfcrepo.properties.management=\"relaxed\" -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61717 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61713 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8686 --headless --contextPath /f4",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1.1. create a container named \"test\"   ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "curl -X POST \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8686/f4/rest"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8686/f4/rest",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" -H \"Slug: test\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2. In a second shell run: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java -Dfcrepo.properties.management=\"relaxed\" -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61718 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61714 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8687 --headless --contextPath /f4",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "3. build fcrepo-import-export r 6b5641",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "4. mkdir export",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "5. Run the export: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d export -a -m export -r ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8686/f4/rest"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8686/f4/rest",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " -b --writeConfig export-config.yml",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "6. Run the importer:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d export -a -m import -r ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8687/f4/rest"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8687/f4/rest",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " -b --writeConfig import-config.yml -M ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8686/f4/rest,http://localhost:8687/f4/rest"
         },
