  "description": "<p>When I export repo A and then import into a repo B (that is running in relaxed mode)  the fedora:lastModified  values of the root containers of do not match between A and B.</p>\n\n<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>1. In one shell run:<br/>\njava -Dfcrepo.properties.management=\"relaxed\" -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61717 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61713 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8686 --headless --contextPath /f4</p>\n\n<p>1.1. create a container named \"test\"   <br/>\ncurl -X POST \"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" -H \"Slug: test\"</p>\n\n<p>2. In a second shell run: </p>\n\n<p>java -Dfcrepo.properties.management=\"relaxed\" -Dfcrepo.dynamic.jms.port=61718 -Dfcrepo.dynamic.stomp.port=61714 -jar fcrepo-webapp-4.8.0-SNAPSHOT-jetty-console-a07a1a46.jar --port 8687 --headless --contextPath /f4</p>\n\n<p>3. build fcrepo-import-export r 6b5641</p>\n\n<p>4. mkdir export</p>\n\n<p>5. Run the export: </p>\n\n<p> java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d export -a -m export -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a> -b --writeConfig export-config.yml</p>\n\n<p>6. Run the importer:</p>\n\n<p>java -jar fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d export -a -m import -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8687/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8687/f4/rest</a> -b --writeConfig import-config.yml -M <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest,http://localhost:8687/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest,http://localhost:8687/f4/rest</a></p>\n\n<p>7.  Curl the root container on each: <br/>\ncurl <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a>;  <br/>\ncurl <a href=\"http://localhost:8687/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8687/f4/rest</a>;</p>\n\n<p>8. Verify that the fedora:lastModified's for the two uri's differ.</p>\n\n\n",
